"body":"Adds an option to the editor settings for scaling all configurable font sizes. Applies to `interface/editor/fonts/main_font_size`, `interface/editor/fonts/code_font_size`, `text_editor/help/help_font_size`, `text_editor/help/help_source_font_size`, `text_editor/help/help_title_font_size`, and `run/output/font_size`.\r\n\r\nIf the user wants to change all interface font sizes at once, they can use this option instead of manually adjusting each font size setting. This may be useful for users with low PPI monitors, for whom text may appear large and take up a lot of space. It may also be useful for users with poor vision who would like to increase the font size.\r\n\r\nThis setting does not scale font sizes that are not included in the editor settings. For example, text on rulers, on rotation control, in texture preview, etc. Perhaps a font size setting should be added for the latter.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1227513e-d534-469a-98fc-d7311a28c1e8\r\n\r\nCloses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14411","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_i